---
layout: layout.njk
title: Case Study
description: Detailed nursing case studies with patient history and analysis.
category: Case Study
---

<div class="category-header">
    <div class="cat-icon">📖</div>

    <h1>Case Study</h1>

    <p class="cat-desc">
        Detailed nursing case studies with patient history, physical examination,
        investigations, disease pathophysiology, nursing management, health
        education, and conclusion. Ready for ANM, GNM, and BSc Nursing
        practical files.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.caseStudy | reverse %}
    <div class="post-card">
        <div class="post-info">
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>

            <p class="post-meta">
                {{ post.date | date("MMMM dd, yyyy") }}
                {% if post.data.reference %}
                | {{ post.data.reference }}
                {% endif %}
            </p>
        </div>

        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">View Case</a>
    </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>
